            "Abbreviations: CDAI = Crohn's Disease Activity Index; FU = follow-up; FXR = LY4395089; IV = intravenous; IWRS = interactive web-response system; N = number of participants; NR = nonresponder; R = responder; SC = subcutaneous.",
